Package: zindi
Title: Client for the 'Zindi' Data Science Competition Platform
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Emmanuel", "Koupoh", email = "emmanuelkoupoh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Muhamed", "Tuo", role = "aut"),
    person("Cédric", "Manouan", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Compete on 'Zindi' <https://zindi.world> from R. Browse and
    search competitions, join them, download their data, upload
    submissions and wait for their scores, follow leaderboards, manage
    teams and read discussions. Credentials are shared with the 'Python',
    'JavaScript' and 'Rust' clients of the same project, so logging in once
    is enough.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/eaedk/zindi-package,
    https://zindi.readthedocs.io/en/latest/
BugReports: https://github.com/eaedk/zindi-package/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    curl,
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite,
    rlang,
    utils
Suggests:
    askpass,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
